{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_019ZPQ8TXAmeVrV8aXLmADwk","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0509_9/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-16\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- exp_019b_pickcube_civo_trigger: PickCube-v1 CIVO trigger — trained dt_emb, subsample ON, dt=2 imagination, H=8. 预期触发 CIVO（trained dt_emb → NVE>1.5x → collapse），验证 CIVO 在 manipulation 环境是否成立（排队等待 GPU）\\\\n- exp_019a_pickcube_baseline: PickCube-v1 baseline — dt=1, no dt_emb (dim=0), subsample OFF. ManiSkill3 manipulation 环境稳定基线，验证 CIVO 诊断在 manipulation 中的适用性（已分配 bjb1-45299 GPU:cuda:1，等待提交）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n- **exp_018_full_sgs_walker_s1** (success): Full-SGS: detach all non-KL gradients from dt_emb (removes 93% obs decoder contribution). If CIVO persists → vulnerability is representation-level; if eliminated → obs decoder gradient is root cause. ← 基于 exp_016e_sgs_walker_s1\\\\n- **exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1** (success): Cheetah Run baseline seed 1 — 建立第二环境 dt=1 参考基线，为跨环境验证 C1/C2 做准备（plan_020）\\\\n  [submit_plan020_cheetah_baseline](/api/workspace-files/projects/event-gated-adaptive-horizon/artifacts/exp_010a_cheetah_baseline_s1/intermediate/submit_plan020_cheetah_baseline.sh)\\\\n- **exp_009d_baseline_walker_s0** (success): Walker Walk baseline seed 0 — 第三独立 baseline seed，建立 v/e 校准参考（plan_010） ← 基于 exp_001_baseline\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 10 / 负向 13 / 失败 6 / 共 41\\\\neval_return_peak: 915.7 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\neval_return_peak_step: 105000 ↓（近 3 次 success）\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n（无活跃 idea，请通过 ideas.md 添加）\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nbjb1-45299: 无 GPU 信息\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n- exp_002_event_gated: 训练失败 — unknown\\\\n- exp_006: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008a: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008c: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008d: 已被终止 — unknown\\\\n- exp_008